Cell["\<\
The Schmidt values give direct access to the bipartite entanglement: squaring \
them produces the reduced-density-matrix spectrum, and -\[Sum] p log p is the \
von Neumann entropy at the bond:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->170009708,ExpressionUUID->"d17c5361-1430-4727-9b28-f02746c696e8"],

