Cell["\<\
The second argument labels bonds, not sites. An MPS of length N has N-1 \
bonds, and the length of the returned list is the bond dimension at that cut \
\[Dash] not necessarily the maximum bond dimension of the MPS:\
\>", "ExampleText",
