Cell["\<\
Out-of-range bond indices do not raise a failure; they fall back to the \
trivial single-value distribution {1.}. Combined with the entropy formula -\
\[Sum] p log p, this is what makes MPSEntanglementEntropy return 0 at the \
boundary indices site=0 and site=N:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->692449558,ExpressionUUID->"c34b2de6-2e9b-4135-b3b3-df478b29ef5f"],

